{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07269","headline":"题大理黄主簿湖上高斋 · 刘长卿","name":"题大理黄主簿湖上高斋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闭门湖水畔，自与白鸥亲。\n竟日窗中岫，终年林下人。\n俗轻儒服弊，家厌法官贫。\n多雨茅檐夜，空洲草径春。\n桃源君莫爱，且作汉朝臣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07269.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07269","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}